[{:db/id "q-68213/selection/9420bd993686febbc7bab9cad06140d93534fa634008fa5d1a005fe09b5d559c" :answer/id #uuid "c11970b8-3b2f-508c-a275-c5366532def1" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\frac{2}{9}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-68213/selection/d971375f57c56d8a55a09f2b892e108787b055ceeadf005d7beed73e388cc467" :answer/id #uuid "fa90a7de-3ab2-55cd-b3b9-d4f01788f2a9" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "0" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-68213/selection/07791849728418b50d59d705e3d959e93383e408886fd319ae3a513a1b7159ba" :answer/id #uuid "837e6fbe-fd90-5bd4-953d-21b234f3313a" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{9}{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-68213/selection/e9bc05c525076ace5dedc0dc52c4f8497f441cd3bf97b666736f75acd9994b26" :answer/id #uuid "c68cfc2f-eb03-53a7-95ba-f090198ae3d2" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-68213/selection/f80535409f78d0e1b5cd0ceb7e72783093e3cde8adf28a5032c83c6dc6b5e490" :answer/id #uuid "d21b60d6-2a35-5f11-b6be-40f7cc60247e" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-2" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-68213/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "cbf8a111-c166-5c94-8106-de3c494a4b88" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-68213/selection/9420bd993686febbc7bab9cad06140d93534fa634008fa5d1a005fe09b5d559c" :answer-field/choices ["q-68213/selection/9420bd993686febbc7bab9cad06140d93534fa634008fa5d1a005fe09b5d559c" "q-68213/selection/d971375f57c56d8a55a09f2b892e108787b055ceeadf005d7beed73e388cc467" "q-68213/selection/07791849728418b50d59d705e3d959e93383e408886fd319ae3a513a1b7159ba" "q-68213/selection/e9bc05c525076ace5dedc0dc52c4f8497f441cd3bf97b666736f75acd9994b26" "q-68213/selection/f80535409f78d0e1b5cd0ceb7e72783093e3cde8adf28a5032c83c6dc6b5e490"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-68213" :question/id #uuid "0082f13b-a36e-5608-84a0-d88b4a772146" :question/math-academy-id "q-68213" :question/problem "Evaluate ${lim}_{x\\to 0}(-\\frac{2x}{9\\operatorname{sin}⁡x}).$" :question/worked-solution "Notice that as $x\\to 0,$ both numerator and denominator approach $0.$\n\nSo, if we attempt to evaluate the limit directly, we get\n\n$$\n{lim}_{x\\to 0}(-\\frac{2x}{9\\operatorname{sin}⁡x})=\\frac{0}{0},\n$$\n\nwhich is an indeterminate form.\n\nInstead, let's recall the following special limit:\n\n$$\n{lim}_{x\\to 0}\\,\\frac{\\operatorname{sin}⁡x}{x}=1\n$$\n\nRewriting the given limit using the algebra of limits and applying our special limit, we get the following:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{lim}_{x\\to 0}(-\\frac{2x}{9\\operatorname{sin}⁡x}) & ={lim}_{x\\to 0}(-\\frac{2}{9}\\cdot \\frac{x}{\\operatorname{sin}⁡x}) \\\\  & =-\\frac{2}{9}\\cdot {lim}_{x\\to 0}\\,\\frac{x}{\\operatorname{sin}⁡x} \\\\  & =-\\frac{2}{9}\\cdot {lim}_{x\\to 0}{(\\frac{\\operatorname{sin}⁡x}{x})}^{-1} \\\\  & =-\\frac{2}{9}\\cdot {[{lim}_{x\\to 0}\\,\\frac{\\operatorname{sin}⁡x}{x}]}^{-1} \\\\  & =-\\frac{2}{9}\\cdot {1}^{-1} \\\\  & =-\\frac{2}{9}\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-68213/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "e686ea1b-94bd-5dad-93e5-9bd7b338e021"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-68213"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-339797/field-1/c087f5dc559272d193745a4428553203b94404f681d8529e6e619348c0528d10" :answer/id #uuid "8ee42bc5-fa4b-551c-bfeb-27613fe50f09" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{3}{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-339797/field-1/d971375f57c56d8a55a09f2b892e108787b055ceeadf005d7beed73e388cc467" :answer/id #uuid "2950a4c5-4cd2-5fdf-83a1-9e5ed2a6947c" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "0" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-339797/field-1" :answer-field/id #uuid "c9cdbd09-f4a6-5047-95aa-51ace608e3b8" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-339797/field-1/c087f5dc559272d193745a4428553203b94404f681d8529e6e619348c0528d10" :answer-field/choices ["q-339797/field-1/c087f5dc559272d193745a4428553203b94404f681d8529e6e619348c0528d10" "q-339797/field-1/d971375f57c56d8a55a09f2b892e108787b055ceeadf005d7beed73e388cc467"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-339797" :question/id #uuid "3808e545-f492-5548-9d11-622244ade519" :question/math-academy-id "q-339797" :question/problem "Evaluate the following limit:\n\n${lim}_{x\\to 0}\\frac{3{sin}^{2}⁡x}{2{x}^{2}}=$\n{{field-1}}" :question/worked-solution "Notice that as $x\\to 0,$ both numerator and denominator approach $0.$\n\nSo, if we attempt to evaluate the limit directly, we get\n\n$$\n{lim}_{x\\to 0}\\,\\frac{3{sin}^{2}⁡x}{2{x}^{2}}=\\frac{0}{0},\n$$\n\nwhich is an indeterminate form.\n\nInstead, let's recall the following special limit:\n\n$$\n{lim}_{x\\to 0}\\,\\frac{\\operatorname{sin}⁡x}{x}=1\n$$\n\nRewriting the given limit using the algebra of limits and applying our special limit, we get the following:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{lim}_{x\\to 0}\\,\\frac{3{sin}^{2}⁡x}{2{x}^{2}} & ={lim}_{x\\to 0}(\\frac{3}{2}\\cdot \\frac{{sin}^{2}⁡x}{{x}^{2}}) \\\\  & =\\frac{3}{2}\\cdot {lim}_{x\\to 0}{(\\frac{\\operatorname{sin}⁡x}{x})}^{2} \\\\  & =\\frac{3}{2}\\cdot {[{lim}_{x\\to 0}\\,\\frac{\\operatorname{sin}⁡x}{x}]}^{2} \\\\  & =\\frac{3}{2}\\cdot {1}^{2} \\\\  & =\\frac{3}{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-339797/field-1"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "e686ea1b-94bd-5dad-93e5-9bd7b338e021"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-339797"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-73539/selection/e53026d2e72b5a9665afb169ba986753fff36dfc4557e460320cb8d9594cece8" :answer/id #uuid "a048d56d-5eca-58be-a964-f7719898380a" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\frac{1}{4}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-73539/selection/ae9425c9e204310ed598f729a242e0b42a2acbbf125bff30bc2080e10b8cf473" :answer/id #uuid "810984a0-1091-5a7a-a2fe-bf08e084fc15" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-4" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-73539/selection/be9eb51cc2f690a7d5b4aa400428edabf5a5d631a176c92b7f40bdd47725ed03" :answer/id #uuid "e1f36692-0b4f-5c83-876e-6760bd89d464" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "4" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-73539/selection/d971375f57c56d8a55a09f2b892e108787b055ceeadf005d7beed73e388cc467" :answer/id #uuid "545e9749-eac0-5c5e-a70a-28de85d98e40" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "0" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-73539/selection/681a4b64a7bb464b7f554c4e26477e3547d3c60cd353fce5dda4ae108b1c4fa5" :answer/id #uuid "ce28f2b1-3019-5500-b7f2-c5f239fff423" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-73539/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "9d8204f1-1402-5ecd-8279-e75270a0cf19" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-73539/selection/e53026d2e72b5a9665afb169ba986753fff36dfc4557e460320cb8d9594cece8" :answer-field/choices ["q-73539/selection/e53026d2e72b5a9665afb169ba986753fff36dfc4557e460320cb8d9594cece8" "q-73539/selection/ae9425c9e204310ed598f729a242e0b42a2acbbf125bff30bc2080e10b8cf473" "q-73539/selection/be9eb51cc2f690a7d5b4aa400428edabf5a5d631a176c92b7f40bdd47725ed03" "q-73539/selection/d971375f57c56d8a55a09f2b892e108787b055ceeadf005d7beed73e388cc467" "q-73539/selection/681a4b64a7bb464b7f554c4e26477e3547d3c60cd353fce5dda4ae108b1c4fa5"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-73539" :question/id #uuid "e061e9cc-d750-5748-977f-50038cee6fb7" :question/math-academy-id "q-73539" :question/problem "Evaluate ${lim}_{x\\to 0}(-\\frac{\\operatorname{sin}⁡x}{4x}).$" :question/worked-solution "Notice that as $x\\to 0,$ both numerator and denominator approach $0.$\n\nSo, if we attempt to evaluate the limit directly, we get\n\n$$\n{lim}_{x\\to 0}(-\\frac{\\operatorname{sin}⁡x}{4x})=\\frac{0}{0},\n$$\n\nwhich is an indeterminate form.\n\nInstead, let's recall the following special limit:\n\n$$\n{lim}_{x\\to 0}\\frac{\\operatorname{sin}⁡x}{x}=1\n$$\n\nRewriting the given limit using the algebra of limits and applying our special limit, we get the following:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{lim}_{x\\to 0}(-\\frac{\\operatorname{sin}⁡x}{4x}) & ={lim}_{x\\to 0}(-\\frac{1}{4}\\cdot \\frac{\\operatorname{sin}⁡x}{x}) \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{4}\\cdot {lim}_{x\\to 0}\\,\\frac{\\operatorname{sin}⁡x}{x} \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{4}\\cdot 1 \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{4}\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-73539/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "e686ea1b-94bd-5dad-93e5-9bd7b338e021"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-73539"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-68215/selection/e9bc05c525076ace5dedc0dc52c4f8497f441cd3bf97b666736f75acd9994b26" :answer/id #uuid "6cd82b22-a513-5d5d-b36e-76d10a005f36" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-68215/selection/d027d90726f5bdbf1525aade1b6bde5c85e2082f2b792dfacee399fcc90e9833" :answer/id #uuid "64fb49f4-2923-5682-b4ef-3e5d41abe167" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{3}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-68215/selection/62a6fd1cf465955cead36d661dcbed2f93206049c15d21d7eebcabb802d1aa54" :answer/id #uuid "1233889c-15f0-522e-931b-36e2e5990ce0" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "3" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-68215/selection/d971375f57c56d8a55a09f2b892e108787b055ceeadf005d7beed73e388cc467" :answer/id #uuid "66c6731f-7c24-5ab4-8f6f-66f1cae88518" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "0" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-68215/selection/ad06fa8bb7e77edd4098e00237718855c96ba589745d004ae1aed5be17e6549c" :answer/id #uuid "6d8f65fb-